          "text": "| Rejet de la demande (Standard API)   |                                 |           | Rejet de la demande (WOOP)      |             |    |\n|--------------------------------------|---------------------------------|-----------|---------------------------------|-------------|----|\n| Id                                   | Code d'erreur                   | Code HTTP | Reasons                         | Commentaire |    |\n| 1                                    | ORDER_NOT_FOUND                 | 404       |                                 |             |    |\n| 2                                    | ORDER_ALREADY_CANCELED          | 202       |                                 |             |    |\n| 3                                    | ORDER_ALREADY_FAILED_TO_LOAD    | 403       | ORDER_ALREADY_FAILED_TO_LOAD    |             |    |\n| 4                                    | ORDER_ALREADY_DELIVERED         | 403       | ORDER_ALREADY_DELIVERED         |             |    |\n| 5                                    | ORDER_ALREADY_FAILED_TO_DELIVER | 403       | ORDER_ALREADY_FAILED_TO_DELIVER |             |    |\n**Demande de Devis de commande**",
