          "text_with_metadata": "headings: Fonctionnalité “Intégration spécifique en API” > EPIC : “Flux de commande CENTIRO” > Détails des Users stories > US- Flux entrant : Mapping des “Services additionnels de la commande”\nquestions_this_excerpt_can_answer: 1.  **What is the specific Centiro service code used to map the standard API service \"Mise en service\"?**\n2.  **Which standard API service ID (1-8) corresponds to the Centiro service \"LEGS_FURNITURE_ASSEMBLY\"?**\n3.  **According to the mapping table, are there any standard API services (specifically ID 7 \"Passage à 4\") that require additional interpretation based on the weight of the order items?**\n\n| Services add.(Standard API)   |                     | Description                                              | Services (Centiro)              |\n|-------------------------------|---------------------|----------------------------------------------------------|---------------------------------|\n| id                            | Service additionnel |                                                          | Service                         |\n| 1                             | Mise en service     |                                                          | IKEA_ELECTRIC_APPLIANCE_INSTALL |\n| 2                             | Montage simple      |                                                          | LEGS_FURNITURE_ASSEMBLY         |\n| 3                             | Montage complexe    |                                                          | FURNITURE_ASSEMBLY              |\n| 4                             | Echange marchandise |                                                          |                                 |\n| 5                             | Reprise recyclage   |                                                          | REMOVAL_WHITEGOODS              |\n| REMOVAL_MATRESSES             |                     |                                                          |                                 |\n| REMOVAL_FURNITURE             |                     |                                                          |                                 |\n| REMOVAL_SOFA                  |                     |                                                          |                                 |\n| 6                             | Retour marchandise  |                                                          |                                 |\n| 7                             | Passage à 4         | à interpréter selon le poids des articles de la commande |                                 |\n| 8                             | Déballage           |                                                          |                                 |"
