          "text": "| Statut (Standard API)   |                                    |             | Statut (CENTIRO)      |    |\n|-------------------------|------------------------------------|-------------|-----------------------|----|\n| Id Statut               | Statut                             | Code Statut | Statut                |    |\n| 1                       | Créée                              |             |                       |    |\n| 2                       | Annoncée                           |             |                       |    |\n| 3                       | Planning validé                    | 19          | Handed over to TSP    |    |\n| 4                       | Echec de chargement                | 96          | Customer refusal      |    |\n| 93:2                    | Failed pick up                     |             |                       |    |\n| 5                       | Chargement validé                  | 19:2        | Picked up at customer |    |\n| 6                       | En cours de livraison              |             |                       |    |\n| 7                       | Livrée                             | 98:2        | Returned to store     |    |\n| 8                       | Echec de livraison                 | 93          | Failed delivery       |    |\n| 9                       | Annulation XL EDS                  | 93          | Failed delivery       |    |\n| 10                      | Annulation Client                  |             |                       |    |\n| 11                      | Annulation Client tardive          |             |                       |    |\n| 12                      | Annulation Client après chargement |             |                       |    |",
